### Phynexora API — example requests (VS Code REST Client / Rider / Visual Studio)
@base = http://localhost:5080
@clientKey = change-me-long-random-string
@adminKey = dev-admin-key-change-me-0123456789

GET {{base}}/health

### Approved testimonials (public)
GET {{base}}/api/testimonials

### Submit feedback (always stored as Pending)
POST {{base}}/api/feedback
X-Api-Key: {{clientKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Jane Perera", "company": "Example Ltd", "rating": 5, "feedback": "The team understood our workflow and delivered a reliable system.", "consentToPublish": true }

### ---------- Admin ----------
GET {{base}}/api/admin/feedback?status=Pending
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Approve feedback (makes it visible in the website testimonials carousel)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/feedback/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/approve
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reviewedBy": "Admin" }

### Reject feedback
POST {{base}}/api/admin/feedback/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/reject
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### List enquiries (filter: New, InReview, Contacted, Proposal, Won, Closed, Spam)
GET {{base}}/api/admin/enquiries?status=New&page=1&pageSize=25
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Update enquiry status
PATCH {{base}}/api/admin/enquiries/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Contacted", "internalNotes": "Called and booked a discovery meeting." }

### Download enquiry attachment
GET {{base}}/api/admin/enquiries/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/attachment
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Chatbot leads
GET {{base}}/api/admin/chat-leads
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}
